---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FlowHero from '../../components/FlowHero.astro';
import { site, projects } from '../../data/site';
import Check from '@lucide/astro/icons/check';

const project = projects.find((p) => p.slug === 'evertune')!;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title={`${project.title} · ${site.name}`} description={project.summary}>
	<article class="container study">
		<a class="back" href={`${base}/#work`}>← All case studies</a>

		<ul class="tags">
			{project.tags.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
		</ul>
		<h1>{project.title}</h1>

		<section>
			<h2>Overview</h2>
			<p>
				Evertune customers have more than one way to create the prompts that measure their AI visibility.
				They can start from a standard template, or use Evertune’s agent to create prompts based on how
				people actually prompt LLMs.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>The problem</h2>
			<p>
				Getting to a set of prompts used to take many steps. We heard a lot of feedback from customers,
				especially new users, who struggled to pick the right type of tracker. There were five main types,
				and one of them had three steps of its own. It was confusing before anyone had written a single prompt.
			</p>
			<!-- Replace this block with an <Image> of the previous creation steps. -->
			<figure class="placeholder">
				<span>Image coming soon</span>
				<figcaption>How tracker creation worked before: five types, one with three steps of its own.</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>The new experience</h2>
			<p>
				With the new agent experience, there is nothing to choose up front. Users begin prompt creation
				in a simple chat, use Evertune’s agent to modify the topics and prompts, and adjust the settings
				before running.
			</p>
			<FlowHero steps={project.flow!} />
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>The impact</h2>
			<p class="pull">
				New customers find it much easier and more intuitive to create trackers and run prompts.
			</p>
			<ul class="wins">
				<li><Check size={20} strokeWidth={1.75} aria-hidden="true" />No onboarding steps needed</li>
				<li>
					<Check size={20} strokeWidth={1.75} aria-hidden="true" />No white-glove service from our customer success team
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.study {
		max-width: 900px;
		padding-top: 140px;
		padding-bottom: 40px;
	}
	.back {
		display: inline-block;
		color: var(--muted);
		text-decoration: none;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
	}
	.back:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-weight: 400;
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin: 16px 0 12px;
	}
	section {
		margin-top: 56px;
	}
	section p {
		max-width: 62ch;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--fg);
	}
	.tags {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
	}
	.tags li {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		border: 1px solid rgba(90, 50, 30, 0.12);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 2px 10px;
	}
	section p.pull {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.3rem);
		line-height: 1.25;
		max-width: 28ch;
		margin: 0 0 24px;
	}
	.wins {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 12px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}
	.wins li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.wins :global(svg) {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		padding: 5px;
		box-sizing: content-box;
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: #fbede5;
		color: #b0694a;
	}
	.placeholder {
		margin: 28px 0 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 10px;
		justify-items: center;
	}
	.placeholder span {
		width: 100%;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 7;
		border: 1.5px dashed rgba(176, 105, 74, 0.4);
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: #fff8f3;
		color: #b0694a;
	}
	.placeholder figcaption {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		text-align: center;
	}
</style>
